{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/0b6e7292fb8b7ba240b6ca9125c89b1a.avif?t=1752923286\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore, hunt, loot, die\u00a0\u2014 and repeat!\u00a0</strong>Confront hordes of monsters and challenging boss fights in a 2.5D class-based roguelike RPG where you can be a Warrior, Merchant, Alchemist \u2014 or even a Cat(\ud83d\udc3e).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/Short_Class_2.gif?t=1752923286\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/56ac692b872524ad90bc2c78b12130c3.avif?t=1752923286\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udf92 Loot, loot, and more LOOT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With over 50+ items for you to discover, each piece you collect and how you combine them, opens up fresh strategies\u2014and unlocks even more loot in return.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Mix &amp; Master Your Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want a Warrior who slings potions like an Alchemist? Or a Wizard with the street smarts of a Merchant? Master your skills, then mix and match to build your own wild playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udcdc Hiring</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your death was not in vain. Other players can hire your ghost characters, and you will be rewarded with special currency to upgrade your next run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Online Leaderboard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Share your score and compete against other players globally in real-time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u269c\ufe0f Rebuild Your Guild</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rescue guild members to expand your base, unlock new features like Boss Card, Exploration, discover new zones, items, and characters, and many more for you to discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/85b43493a9ec50ce5894b81450a68396.avif?t=1752923286\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/Short_Items.gif?t=1752923286\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/Short_Customise.gif?t=1752923286\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/Short_Guild.gif?t=1752923286\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/Divider2.png?t=1752923286\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/extras/Banner_Community.png?t=1752923286\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3792120?t=1752923286","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/2e01ea2eda15343041392a4d8376448b2bc2fa0d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752923286","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/cd169b396e9922eac052ebd305addec49be71d85/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752923286","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792120/cd16